# SCSS Styling Conventions

## ⚠️ MANDATORY PRE-STYLING CHECKLIST ⚠️

Before writing ANY SCSS, ensure you follow these conventions.

## CSS Variables (CRITICAL)

### Always Check StylingComponent.php First

**Before creating ANY new variable**, check `inc/app/editor/StylingComponent.php` for existing CSS variables.

Prefer **semantic** tokens in new SCSS; brand primitives and legacy aliases remain for existing code.

Available variable categories:
- **Fonts**: `--ts-font-heading`, `--ts-font-body`, `--ts-font-secondary`, `--ts-font-button`, `--ts-font-regular`, `--ts-font-semibold`, `--ts-font-bold`, `--ts-font-light`, `--ts-font-family-sans`
- **Font sizes**: `--ts-font-size-*` (incl. `large-md` / `medium-md`), `--ts-line-height-*`, `--ts-icon-size-default`
- **Semantic colors** (preferred): `--ts-color-text`, `--ts-color-text-muted`, `--ts-color-text-inverse`, `--ts-color-surface`, `--ts-color-surface-muted`, `--ts-color-border`, `--ts-color-action`, `--ts-color-action-hover`, `--ts-color-on-action`
- **Brand primitives**: `--ts-color-primary`, `--ts-color-primary-hover`, `--ts-color-on-primary`, `--ts-color-secondary` (+ hover/on), `--ts-color-tertiary` (+ hover/on), `--ts-color-danger` (+ hover/on), `--ts-color-white`, `--ts-color-black`, `--ts-color-grey`, `--ts-color-light`
- **Legacy font colors**: `--ts-font-color-primary`, `--ts-font-color-secondary`, `--ts-font-color-white`
- **Font weights**: `--ts-font-weight-light` … `--ts-font-weight-bold` (bold = 600)
- **Elevation** (preferred): `--ts-elevation-0` … `--ts-elevation-4` — legacy `--ts-shadow-sm`, `--ts-shadow-sm-hover`, `--ts-shadow-md`, `--ts-shadow-card` alias these
- **Motion**: `--ts-duration-fast`, `--ts-duration-base`, `--ts-easing-standard`, `--ts-transition-colors`, `--ts-transition` (no longer `transition: all`)
- **Focus / disabled**: `--ts-focus-ring`, `--ts-focus-ring-inverse`, `--ts-focus-ring-offset`, `--ts-opacity-disabled`
- **Z-index**: `--ts-z-index-dropdown`, `--ts-z-index-sticky`, `--ts-z-index-modal`, `--ts-z-index-toast`, `--ts-z-index-admin`
- **Radius** (preferred): `--ts-radius-none`, `--ts-radius-xs` … `--ts-radius-xxl`, `--ts-radius-pill` — legacy `--ts-border-radius-*` / `--ts-button-border-radius` still work
- **Space**: `--ts-space-1` … `--ts-space-16` (0.25rem steps); also `--ts-gutter-width`, `--ts-row-gap-*`
- **Grid**: `--ts-base-width`, `--ts-narrow-width`, `--ts-gutter-width`
- **Form controls**: `--ts-form-field-height`, `--ts-form-field-border`, `--ts-form-field-border-radius`, `--ts-form-field-background-color`
- **Buttons**: styles `filled|outlined|ghost|text|alternative` × colors `primary|secondary|tertiary|danger` via local `--ts-btn-*` in `component-button.scss` — do not add PHP `btn-*-color-*` keys
- **Feature adapters**: GF mail tokens live in `GravityFormMailComponent`; admin-bar light tokens in `AdminBarLightComponent` (not in `StylingComponent`)

### Fallback Color Rule (CRITICAL)

**Always use color NAMES as fallbacks, NEVER hex codes.**

```scss
// ✅ CORRECT - color name fallback
background-color: var(--ts-color-grey-light, grey);
color: var(--ts-font-color-primary, black);
border-color: var(--ts-color-border, lightgrey);

// ❌ WRONG - hex code fallback
background-color: var(--ts-color-grey-light, #f5f5f5);
color: var(--ts-font-color-primary, #515151);
```

## Units (CRITICAL)

### Always Use REM

All sizing must use `rem` units (except for very specific cases like borders).

```scss
// ✅ CORRECT
font-size: 1.5rem;
padding: 1rem 2rem;
margin-bottom: 2rem;
border-radius: 0.5rem;
gap: 1rem;

// ❌ WRONG
font-size: 24px;
padding: 16px 32px;
margin-bottom: 32px;
```

### Use Gutter Width Variable

For consistent spacing, prefer `--ts-gutter-width` or row gap variables:

```scss
// ✅ CORRECT - uses gutter width
margin-bottom: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);
padding: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);
gap: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);

// ✅ CORRECT - uses row gap variables
margin-bottom: var(--ts-row-gap-default, 2rem);
padding-top: var(--ts-row-gap-large, 4rem);
```

## Typography (CRITICAL)

### Do NOT Add Typography Styles

Text elements inherit typography from the global styles. **Do NOT add unnecessary font styling** that would need to be overridden everywhere.

```scss
// ❌ WRONG - unnecessary typography that needs overriding
&__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: var(--ts-font-weight-bold, 600);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ts-font-color-primary, black);
}

// ✅ CORRECT - minimal styling, let typography classes handle fonts
&__title {
    margin: 0;
}
```

Only add typography styles when:
1. The design explicitly requires different styling from the default
2. You need to override inherited styles for a specific use case

## Image Dimensions

### Get Dimensions from PHP Class

Image dimensions are defined in the block/post-type PHP class `__construct`. Use those exact dimensions:

```php
// In PHP class __construct
self::setSnippetImageSize([470, 350]);
```

```scss
// ✅ CORRECT - matches PHP dimensions
&__image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 470 / 350;
    object-fit: cover;
}

// Or using explicit dimensions
&__image-wrapper {
    width: 29.375rem; // 470px in rem (470/16)
    height: 21.875rem; // 350px in rem (350/16)
}
```

## Mobile-First Approach (CRITICAL)

### Always Write Mobile Styles First

Start with mobile styles, then add breakpoints for larger screens using `mq-up` mixin.

```scss
.section-content {
    // Mobile styles first (no media query)
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);
    padding: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);

    @include mixins.mq-up(md) {
        // Tablet and up
        flex-direction: row;
        padding: var(--ts-row-gap-medium, 3rem);
    }

    @include mixins.mq-up(lg) {
        // Desktop and up
        gap: var(--ts-row-gap-large, 4rem);
    }
}
```

**Available breakpoints**: xs (0), sm (576px), md (768px), lg (992px), xl (1200px), xxl (1400px)

## BEM Naming (CRITICAL)

### Use BEM with Maximum One Level Deep

```scss
.section-content {
    $self: &;

    // Element
    &__header {
        // ...
    }

    &__content {
        // ...
    }

    // Modifier on block
    &--dark {
        background-color: var(--ts-color-primary, blue);

        // Reference element within modifier
        #{$self}__header {
            color: var(--ts-color-white, white);
        }
    }

    // Modifier on element
    &__button {
        &--active {
            // ...
        }
    }
}
```

### ❌ Never Nest Elements

```scss
// ❌ WRONG - nested elements
.section-content {
    &__header {
        &__title {
            // Too deep!
        }
    }
}

// ✅ CORRECT - flat structure
.section-content {
    &__header {
        // ...
    }

    &__header-title {
        // Combine if needed
    }
}
```

## Common Patterns

### Border Radius

Always use the CSS variable:

```scss
border-radius: var(--ts-border-radius-xs, 1rem);
// Or for buttons
border-radius: var(--ts-button-border-radius, 0.5rem);
```

### Transitions

```scss
transition: var(--ts-transition, all 0.3s ease-in);
```

### Shadows

```scss
box-shadow: var(--ts-shadow-sm, 0 0.25rem 0.25rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));

&:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--ts-shadow-sm-hover, 0 0.5rem 0.5rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15));
}
```

### Card/Container Pattern

```scss
.section-card {
    $self: &;

    background-color: var(--ts-color-white, white);
    border-radius: var(--ts-border-radius-xs, 1rem);
    box-shadow: var(--ts-shadow-sm, 0 0.25rem 0.25rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
    padding: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);
    transition: var(--ts-transition, all 0.3s ease-in);

    &:hover {
        box-shadow: var(--ts-shadow-sm-hover, 0 0.5rem 0.5rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15));
    }

    &__image {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: var(--ts-border-radius-xs, 1rem);
    }

    &__content {
        margin-top: var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem);
    }

    &__title {
        margin: 0;
    }
}
```

## Quick Reference

| Property | Use |
|----------|-----|
| Spacing | `var(--ts-space-4, 1rem)`, `var(--ts-gutter-width, 2rem)`, or `var(--ts-row-gap-*, *)` |
| Border radius | `var(--ts-radius-sm, …)` or legacy `var(--ts-border-radius-xs, 1rem)` |
| Button radius | `var(--ts-button-border-radius, 0.5rem)` or `var(--ts-radius-pill, 9999px)` |
| Transition | Prefer property lists + `var(--ts-duration-base)` / `var(--ts-easing-standard)`; legacy `--ts-transition` still exists |
| Elevation | `var(--ts-elevation-1, …)` (legacy `--ts-shadow-sm` still works) |
| Colors | Prefer semantic `--ts-color-text` / `--ts-color-action`; always check `StylingComponent.php` |
| Units | Always `rem` |
| Fallbacks | Always color names, never hex |

